#!/sbin/openrc-run
# Side buttons: grabs the power/volume evdev nodes and publishes gestures on
# /run/chef/buttond.sock; with nothing claiming them a short power press
# toggles the screen-off flag /run/chef/screen-off, and power held 3 s (buzz
# at 1.5 s, long buzz at 3 s) then released runs `poweroff`, the orderly
# way down through init (::shutdown, SIGTERM to all, RB_POWER_OFF). The
# PMIC hard-resets on its own at ~8.7 s held. `buttond watch` to look
# (docs/features/buttons-and-power-off.md).

description="Side buttons and power-off"
supervisor=supervise-daemon
command=/usr/bin/buttond

depend() {
	use logger
}
